ExpressiveOS is an independent ROM, made by denson9874 with Claude (Anthropic's AI) as its development partner. It's built on LineageOS and AOSP and started from Evolution X's open source code, but it isn't an Evolution X build, and it isn't affiliated with or endorsed by the Evolution X team. See each source repository's license and upstream notices.

